multiflexi-realpad (1.0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * checkAvailability(): send login and password as POST form fields instead
    of HTTP Basic auth, which Realpad rejected with HTTP 400.
  * checkAvailability(): report Available for HTTP 2xx only; 400, 401 and 403
    are Misconfigured, 429 is Degraded, anything else is Unavailable.

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:46:39 +0100

multiflexi-realpad (1.0.0) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: Realpad credential prototype for MultiFlexi core.
    Provides REALPAD_USERNAME/REALPAD_PASSWORD fields and a
    checkAvailability() live check against the Realpad API.

 -- "Vítězslav Dvořák" <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Wed, 12 Aug 2026 20:00:00 +0200
